cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference or implement this protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Minecraft Identity Protocol (MIP)"
abstract: >-
  A backend-agnostic protocol for authenticating a Minecraft account over HTTP, either from
  inside a game client/mod or from a plain browser, converging on one identity representation
  and one session-issuance step.
authors:
  - family-names: Deftu
    email: me@deftu.dev
url: "https://github.com/Deftu/minecraft-identity-protocol"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-09-15
